{"name":"Even Evan","hex":"#998371","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"even","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Flat and level.","Without great variation."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An even number."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/even"}],"entries":[{"title":"Evan","blocks":[{"text":"Evan is a Welsh and English masculine given name, derived from Iefan, a Welsh form of the name John. Evan can also occasionally be found as a shortened version of Greek names like Evangelos, Evander, or Evandro. While predominantly male, the name is occasionally given to women, as with the actress Evan Rachel Wood. It may also be encountered as a surname, although Evans is a far more common form within this context."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evan"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"even":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/En-us-even.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1e/En-us-even.ogg/En-us-even.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey Carpet from above","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg/500px-Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","share":0.31375},{"title":"Eastern grey kangaroo (Macropus giganteus) Mount Annan composite of 6","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg/500px-Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","ratio":4.413151003782368,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eastern_grey_kangaroo_(Macropus_giganteus)_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","share":0.304375},{"title":"Evan Gattis in 2014","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wik